        "Description": "47 This is an Code Black!\rYou know the group that is known as &quot;The Twin Assassins&quot;.\rThe have planted an bomb yet again for revenge somewhere in Sapienza.\rThis time you only have 20 minutes before the bomb is detonated by one of them so you have take the assassins out. \rOur intel says there are atleast 3 of them, spread across the town. \rThe group has an unknown amount of assassins, so 47 be ready to also eliminate some more of them in the future...\r\rgood luck 47 and hurry!",
